Your instinct is right - move the Task creation inside the button action.

Instead of creating once at the top, create a fresh Task each click:

```swift
Button("Add Task") {
    let newTask = Task(title: "Test", color: "#FF0000")
    modelContext.insert(newTask)
}
```

Try it - click a few times, you should see multiple "Test" tasks appear.

